{"parse": {"title": "纯雨滴", "pageid": 2249, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"纯雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"纯雨滴\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>纯雨滴</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-202 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/CurrencyIcon-202_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-202_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/CurrencyIcon-202_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-202_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/CurrencyIcon-202_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-202_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#2</div></div><hr /><div>神秘学界昂贵无比的货币。可用于征集与恢复细胞活性。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">双胞胎中更沉默的那个，兄弟姐妹中最踏实稳重的那个，总在他人需要时提供帮助的那个。它拥有一切美德，它走在雨幕队列的最后，也最先落回地面。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "纯雨滴"}}